      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, we're finalizing the pitch for the new painkiller launch. We really want to go big with a campaign centered on \"Superior Rapid Action and Patient Comfort\" to differentiate us from the generics. Based on the clinical data we have, can we safely move forward with an emphasis on both the speed of relief and a superior comfort profile?",
